sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TF as Terraform core
    participant P as internal/provider<br/>(schema resource)
    participant R as internal/{resource}<br/>(crud_actions.go)
    participant C as internal/client<br/>(GpcnClient)
    participant API as GPCN API

    TF->>P: Create / Read / Update / Delete
    P->>P: ctx = client.WithCorrelationID(ctx)
    P->>R: CreateNetwork(client, ctx, model)
    R->>R: build map[string]any body, json.Marshal
    R->>C: DoWithRetry(request)
    Note over C: authTransport adds x-api-key,<br/>x-Correlation-ID, prepends Host.<br/>Retries 5xx / 429 with backoff.
    C->>API: POST /v1/resource/...
    API-->>C: 202 { jobId }
    C-->>R: response body
    R->>C: PerformLongPolling(client, ctx, action, jobId)
    loop until job done or timeout
        C->>API: POST /v1/.../jobs-status { jobIds }
        API-->>C: job status (backoff on pending)
    end
    C-->>R: completed job
    R->>C: GetJobResourceID(jobResp)
    R->>API: GET /v1/resource/{id}
    API-->>R: full resource object
    R-->>P: response struct
    P->>P: MapXxxResponseToModel(ctx, resp, &model)
    P->>TF: resp.State.Set(ctx, model)
